udio: Charles Gibson, George Stephanopoulos)  The status of the bailout negotiations with the prospects for reaching a deal over the weekend, the support for a bill from some House Republicans and tonight's debate amidst the financial crisis that will likely have a huge audience discussed.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  McCain's presence on \"This Week\" this Sunday noted.  \n\n(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Stock Market Report.  \n\n(Studio: Betsy Stark)  The anger of Main Street Americans over rescuing Wall Street featured; scenes shown of protests in the streets; details given of the view that taxpayers will be paying billions.  [Dartmouth Tuck School of Business professor Robert HANSEN&#134;- says \"bailout\" is misleading: it is a purchase and resale.]  [Harvard University professor Kenneth ROGOFF&#134;- says money may even be made.]  Diagram shown to illustrate how the government plan will work to use the fund to buy bad assets from financial institutions and repackage them for resale to better off financial institutions.  The risks for the taxpayers enumerated. ", "segment_duration": 510, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 905738, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "NoaojF4itC", "broadcast_date": "2008-09-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 905737, "segment_id": "dA0f13qNyN", "segment_broadcast_id": "NoaojF4itC", "segment_title": "Economy: Bank Failure / Washington Mutual", "segment_description": "(Studio: Charles Gibson)  Report introduced.   (Seattle: Karl Karlinsky)  The largest-ever bank failure in the US with Washington Mutual seized by the government and sold to JPMorgan Chase explained; details given about the run on deposits by WaMu customers, a potential merger of Wachovia and Citigroup and the likely failure of more banks.  [Sterne Agee banking analyst Sean RYAN&#134;- offers perspective on the scope of this bank failure.]  FDIC public service ad featuring financial analyst Suze Orman shown.  [on the street, MAN&nbsp- reacts.] ", "segment_duration": 130, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63560.0", "legacy_segment_id": 905739, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "NoaojF4itC", "broadcast_date": "2008-09-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 905737, "segment_id": "IrRe8sYx9p", "segment_broadcast_id": "NoaojF4itC", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Studio: Charles Gibson)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 40, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63690.0", "legacy_segment_id": 905740, "network_name": "ABC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "NoaojF4itC", "broadcast_date": "2008-09-26", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 1, "distributor": 8, "broadcast_title": "World News Tonight", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1680, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 905737, "segment_id": "63eJmPKoMb", "segment_broadcast_id": "NoaojF4itC", "segment_title": "(Commercial: Tylenol; BP; Centrum; NetZero; Purina.)", "segment_description": " ", "segment_duration": 120, "segment_type_id": 3, 